{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00660","headline":"郊庙歌辞 享太庙乐章 福和 · 张说","name":"郊庙歌辞 享太庙乐章 福和","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"备礼用乐，崇亲致尊。\n诚通慈降，敬彻爱存。\n献怀称寿，啐感承恩。\n皇帝孝德，子孙千亿。\n大包天域，长亘不极。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张说","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00660.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00660","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}